        "text": "When an advertiser funds a coding task that runs on your computer, the assistant now adds a new way to install software packages that is safer and more automated than before. Instead of the assistant typing install commands into your terminal, it now uses a built-in tool that checks with the server whether a package is allowed, picks the correct version, and installs it without running any hidden scripts that could harm your project. This change only affects people who accept and run these advertiser-sponsored tasks in their terminal; it does not change how you use the free AI coding assistant for your own projects, and you do not need to update your settings or take any action.",
